# Goal: no parameters for now; the node resolves the stored model and camera
# topic from its own parameters.

---
# Result: the highest-ranked reachable TCP grasp pose.
# Callers must check this flag before using the pose fields.
bool food_found
# The frame remains explicit because geometry_msgs/Pose has no frame metadata.
geometry_msgs/Pose grasp_pose
string reference_frame

---
# Feedback: a short description of the current pipeline stage.
string stage
